      "description": "Discarding Cori-Steel Cutter over Mox Amber when there are no legendary creatures or planeswalkers on board to activate Mox Amber. Cori-Steel Cutter could generate 1/1 prowess tokens via Flurry on second spell each turn, providing board presence and pressure against an opponent at 9 life.",
