    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to chump block a 6/6 Devourer of Destiny with an Eldrazi Spawn token, taking 6 damage to drop from 13 to 7 life against an Eldrazi deck that can threaten lethal quickly. The 0/1 Spawn token's sacrifice-for-{C} value is far less than 6 life points at this life total.",
