    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Qwen3 Spike declined to activate Aether Spellbomb to bounce Devourer of Destiny during combat, taking 6 extra damage and dropping to 7 life instead of staying at 13. At 13 life against an opponent with two more Devourers and Ugin in hand, going to 7 instead of 13 is a huge difference in survivability. Bouncing Devourer also forces Llama4 to spend another full turn recasting it (triggering exile again, but costing tempo).",
      "action_taken": "Declined to activate any abilities during combat, taking 8 total damage (6 from Devourer + 2 from Icetill Explorer) going to 5 life.",
      "better_line": "Activate Aether Spellbomb paying {U} to bounce Devourer of Destiny, taking only 2 damage and staying at 11 life. This buys significant time against the opponent's massive threats.",
