    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Kozilek's Command's first mode creates X 0/1 Eldrazi Spawn tokens. By choosing Qwen3 Spike as the target player, Llama4 Libby is giving their opponent additional creature tokens (which can be sacrificed for mana or used as blockers/chump blockers). The opponent already has Eldrazi Spawn tokens on board. Llama4 Libby should be creating the Spawn tokens for themselves, not their opponent.",
