    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Llama4 Libby appears confused about whose turn it is ('I'll wait for my turn') during their own combat phase. With a 6/6 Devourer of Destiny and the opponent at 5 life, they should be attacking to force chump blocks from Eldrazi Spawn tokens, depleting the opponent's blockers for a lethal attack next turn. Even without trample, pressuring the opponent is important.",
