    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "At 5 life facing a 6/6 Devourer of Destiny, Engineered Explosives threatens to destroy critical board pieces. If EE is set to 0, it destroys Mox Opal and both Eldrazi Spawn tokens (needed for chump blocking). If set to 1, it destroys Lavaspur Boots and Aether Spellbomb. Either way, this is devastating for a player at 5 life. Qwen3 Spike has TWO Metallic Rebukes in hand and plenty of artifacts to improvise, so they can counter this cheaply while still holding a counterspell for future threats.",
