      "description": "Failed to play a land before casting Emrakul. Playing Bojuka Bog first would exile Qwen3 Spike's graveyard (containing Emry, artifacts, and other relevant cards) before they get priority to respond to Emrakul's cast, and would ensure the land drop isn't missed if something unexpected happens.",
